. I just press the button and relax while it does the work.","author":"Michael, 34"}},"review_AzYBQN":{"type":"review","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_1321315666_1.png","stars":5,"quote":"Perfect gift for anyone who loves grilling. Looks cool and genuinely useful.","author":"Alex & Sarah"}},"review_cBjTc4":{"type":"review","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_1321315666_1.png","stars":5,"quote":"Super easy to use and satisfying to watch. Everyone asks about it when we have people over.","author":"Daniel, 29"}},"review_WQka3p":{"type":"review","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_1321315666_1.png","stars":5,"quote":"Perfect gift for anyone who loves grilling. Looks cool and genuinely useful.","author":"Alex & Sarah"}},"review_XaKbPV":{"type":"review","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_1321315666.png","stars":5,"quote":"This thing saves me so much time after every BBQ. I just press the button and relax while it does the work.","author":"Michael, 34"}}},"block_order":["review_63HeWd","review_wiw4DU","review_Hq6Qhi","review_eqekKc","review_qmtqne","review_AzYBQN","review_cBjTc4","review_WQka3p","review_XaKbPV"],"name":"Reviews Slider","settings":{"heading_highlight_1":"REAL","heading_middle":"REVIEWS FROM","heading_highlight_2":"REAL","heading_end":"GRILL OWNERS","subheading":"See why thousands of grill lovers are switching to Grillbot.","padding_top_desktop":60,"padding_bottom_desktop":60,"padding_top_mobile":60,"padding_bottom_mobile":60}},"grillbot_faq_section_cbENrr":{"type":"grillbot-faq-section","blocks":{"faq_item_UtjdLx":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"What exactly is a Grillbot and how does it work?","answer":"<p><strong>The Grillbot is your grill-cleaning sidekick.<\/strong><\/p><p>Just place it on your grill, press a button, and let it go to work, no scrubbing, no mess. Grillbot's motorized brushes clean your grates (hot or cold, up to 250°F), and a built-in alarm sound if your grill gets too hot. Effortless, automated, and oddly satisfying to watch.<\/p>","default_open":true}},"faq_item_fN7A4V":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Will Grillbot work on my grill (gas, charcoal, infrared, Green Egg,Blackstone, etc.)?","answer":"<p><strong>Yes, Grillbot works on all major grill types, with a lid!<\/strong><\/p><p>Whether it’s gas, charcoal, ceramic, infrared, or something in between, Grillbot is designed to handle them all.<\/p><p>If you can grill on it, Grillbot can clean it.<\/p>","default_open":false}},"faq_item_RE8rt8":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Will Grillbot scratch or damage my grill?","answer":"<p>Only if you're using the wrong brush but we've got you covered.<\/p><p>To protect your grill, choose the brush that matches your grate:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Brass:<\/strong> Great for porcelain or stainless steel (gentle and effective)<\/li><li><strong>Nylon:<\/strong> All-purpose and safe for all grill types<\/li><li><strong>Stainless Steel:<\/strong> Best for cast iron and expanded steel (heavy-duty)<\/li><\/ul><p>Using a degreaser before cleaning and avoiding overuse can further reduce wear over time.<\/p>","default_open":false}},"faq_item_aGCRpc":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Will this make my dirty grill look brand new?","answer":"<p><strong>Not overnight but with regular use, Grillbot keeps your grill in top shape.<\/strong><\/p><p>Grillbot is built for maintenance, not restoration. Over time, it removes grease and buildup, helping your grill cook better and last longer.<\/p><p><em>The more you use it, the better it gets.<\/em><\/p>","default_open":false}},"faq_item_jqd7en":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"How do I know which brush is right for my grill?","answer":"<p>Here’s a quick brush guide:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Nylon:<\/strong> Softest and longest-lasting. Safe for all grills.<\/li><li><strong>Brass:<\/strong> Best for porcelain\/stainless steel. Prevents scratches.<\/li><li><strong>Stainless Steel:<\/strong> Deep-cleaning for cast iron or expanded steel.<\/li><\/ul><p><em>Not sure? Start with Nylon - it’s the safest bet for most users.<\/em><\/p>","default_open":false}},"faq_item_PRgKCk":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Is the price worth it vs. a $15 brush?","answer":"<p>If you grill three times a week, that's 150+ post-cook cleanings a year. The brush costs you energy, presence, and consistency — every single time. You're not comparing tools. You're comparing having your time back versus spending it at the grate. And as a gift, there's simply no comparison.<\/p>","default_open":false}}},"block_order":["faq_item_UtjdLx","faq_item_fN7A4V","faq_item_RE8rt8","faq_item_aGCRpc","faq_item_jqd7en","faq_item_PRgKCk"],"name":"FAQ","settings":{"background":"#ffffff","text_color":"#080808","heading_color":"#080808","button_fallback_text":"Ask Us Anything →","button_bg":"#b6d22f","button_text_color":"#080808","faq_bg":"#ffffff","faq_border":"#cccccc","faq_heading_color":"#080808","faq_text_color":"#525252","enable_faq_structured_data":false,"heading":"Frequently Asked Questions","button_text":"View all FAQs","button_url":"shopify:\/\/pages\/grillbot-faq","padding_desktop_top":80,"padding_desktop_bottom":80,"padding_mobile_top":40,"padding_mobile_bottom":40}},"footer_banner_eTqdwQ":{"type":"footer--banner","name":"footer Banner","settings":{"heading":"TRY GRILLBOT FOR 60 DAYS WITH ZERO RISK.","subheading":"If you're not completely satisfied, return it — no questions asked.","background_image_desktop":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_2121451378_4a1c9edd-5082-4a55-b80b-a2aaae42df4d.png","background_image_mobile":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_2121451378_1_edbd3cec-a7d5-4d33-af4b-305c13f10b64.png","badge_1_text":"60-Day Risk-Free Trial","badge_2_text":"Free Shipping on Orders $100","badge_3_text":"Backed by a 1-Year Warranty","button_label":"Shop Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/robot-